    {
      "source": "Querydsl specific fragment for extending\n<a href=\"../support/SimpleNeo4jRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.repository.support\"><code>SimpleNeo4jRepository</code></a> with an\nimplementation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>. Provides the necessary\ninfrastructure for translating Query-DSL predicates into conditions that are passed\nalong to the Cypher-DSL and eventually to the template infrastructure. This fragment\nwill be loaded by the repository infrastructure when a repository is declared extending\nthe above interface.",
      "translation": "用于扩展 <a href=\"../support/SimpleNeo4jRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.repository.support\"><code>SimpleNeo4jRepository</code></a> 的 QueryDSL 特定片段，该扩展包含 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a> 的实现。此片段提供了将 Query-DSL 谓词转换为传递给 Cypher-DSL 并最终传递到模板基础设施的条件所需的必要基础设施。当声明一个继承上述接口的仓库时，该片段将由仓库基础设施加载。",
      "count": 1
    },
